  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Echoing Green (EG) COVID 19 - Edom Nutrional Solutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to provide seed capital to Edom Nutritional Solutions to support their production line by conveniently converting it to producing masks that are in high demand. This will include replacing eight machine stitching component with Baby Lock stitching capacity, material/fabric roller and ventilated cubicles for each of the eight operators to produce at least 2,000 masks per day. Due to the pandemic, 50% of the production line was put on hold because the number of staff per shift was drasticly decreased. The fund will also be used to retain the employees.</narrative>
  </description>
